/Title (A Zoho Creator account was successfully created, and the platform architecture and user interface were explored. The experiment demonstrated that Zoho Creator provides an intuitive low-code environment with tools such as forms, reports, workflows, pages, and dashboards, enabling rapid application development with minimal programming effort.)
